the differential system \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(\[PartialD]\\), \
\\(x\\)]\\)j=Mj. The second argument toj corresponds to additional rules \
applied after reduction. If x is a list of variables, the result is also a \
list of the corresponding matrices.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
            FrameMargins->{{10, 10}, {8, 10}}],
