MappedSectors[borsalino5] \[LongDash] mapped sectors.\\n    SR[borsalino5][\
\[Ellipsis]] \[LongDash] symmetry relations for j[borsalino5,\[Ellipsis]] \
from UniqueSectors[borsalino5].\\n    jSymmetries[borsalino5,\[Ellipsis]] \
\[LongDash] symmetry rules for the sector js[borsalino5,\[Ellipsis]] in \
UniqueSectors[borsalino5].\\n    jRules[borsalino5,\[Ellipsis]] \[LongDash] \
reduction rules for j[borsalino5,\[Ellipsis]] from MappedSectors[borsalino5].\
\\n    SectorsMappings[borsalino5] gives the list of mappings of all sectors \
from MappedSectors[borsalino5] to UniqueSectors[borsalino5].\"\>"], "Print",
