Cell["\<\
Suppose we want to choose some other master integrals, e.g. we want to \
replace mis[[9]]=j[borsalino3, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0] with j[borsalino3, \
1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0]. This is the ever-present triangle-triangle-loop \
diagram. Or j[borsalino3, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0], the jet-pack diagram.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.886883498295726*^9, 3.8868835454333344`*^9}, {
  3.886883667791916*^9, 3.88688367630656*^9}, {3.9723632464006233`*^9, 
